/S /P
/E (At the core of SPIDEX lies the Arduino Nano, which serves as the main controller. It is mounted on a Nano Expansion Board to simplify wiring, provide additional power rails, and organize I/O pin connections.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
