/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The HC-05 Bluetooth Module provides wireless communication between the robot and a mobile application. It operates using a serial interface \(TX/RX pins\) connected to the Arduino Nano. Through this link, the user can send commands \(e.g., Forward, Backward, Left, Right, Stop\) from the app, which are decoded by the Nano to trigger corresponding gait movements.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [6 7]
>>
